      <description>&lt;p&gt;Finished it, such a nice game, easily one of my fav this year. If Forbidden Solitaire gets extra content/DLC I&amp;#39;ll be there day one. Fun fact I played this almost entirely on a Steam Machine, which might sound weird but it was very comfortable to casually play with the trackpad/right stick.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
